      "source": [
        "# Music Annotation Project V9.0A\n",
        "## Audit-Resolved Mask-Authority Transfer Experiment\n",
        "\n",
        "**Runtime:** CPU when Notebook 06 confidence maps already exist.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is a clean replacement for the mixed resolver versions. It contains:\n",
        "\n",
        "- one resolver only;\n",
        "- no `paired`, `resolved`, `draft_resolution`, or `review_resolution` legacy variables;\n",
        "- Notebook 07 `PageXXX` as the canonical page identity;\n",
        "- backward resolution from Notebook 07 review records to Notebook 06 draft artefacts;\n",
        "- explicit unresolved-lineage policy and diagnostics;\n",
        "- separate raw-YOLO, confidence-gated-YOLO and reviewed-mask arms;\n",
        "- clean truth loaded only after masks and corrected outputs are locked;\n",
        "- a curated Final Upload Package.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Scientific boundary\n",
        "\n",
        "The YOLO confidence map, authoritative annotation mask, prepared removal mask and reconstruction routing are separate artefacts. Detector confidence is not correction safety. The notebook does not authorise automatic mask authority or production output.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Gate policy\n",
        "\n",
        "The notebook deliberately leaves the Notebook 06 detector-confidence gate unset. The retrieved project record does not establish a frozen detector-confidence threshold, and the V8.2 0.90 value is an observed-print probability threshold, not a YOLO mask-authority threshold. Set the two clearly labelled configuration values only when the genuine historical detector policy is identified."
      ],
      "id": "jXycksU1XVFC"
    },
